  "groups": [],
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "assumptions",
      "text": "Synthetic fixed-size segment model, not video playback or a WebRTC protocol implementation. Cohorts preserve aggregate unicast byte counts and conservatively wait for their last member. Peer upload budgets are shared across segment IDs; seeding requires downloaded receipts. Relay fraction and prices are assumptions. Crash peer assistance to observe CDN fallback.",
